y>Keeping publishing reliable across two platforms.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Arcus operates its marketing website in Framer, while the dYdX website uses Webflow. The combined engagement covers maintenance and improvements across both sites.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our work on Arcus includes blog publishing fixes, typography, redirects and search visibility. We support the existing website and its team; the original site design was supplied by others.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The work we delivered.</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Framer publishing</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8